ESPN"},{"headline":"Viral couple from Wake Forest-Georgia Tech game speaks on 'Today' show","description":"The couple's intense discussion was caught on an ESPN broadcast of Wake Forest and Georgia Tech's Week 12 game and went viral.","published":"2026-11-24T21:02:51.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50584732/wake-forest-georgia-tech-viral-couple-speaks","type":"Story","byline":"Kalan Hooks","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Colorado's Deion Sanders shrugs off hot-seat chatter before UCF","description":"Deion Sanders handles outside chatter -- in this case, speculation over his future as coach at Colorado -- by simply tuning out the noise.","published":"2026-11-24T21:29:37.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50585728/colorado-sanders-shrugs-hot-seat-chatter-ucf","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Memphis' Charles Huff says he's not candidate for Maryland head coaching job","description":"Memphis' Charles Huff said he's not a candidate for the head coaching vacancy at Maryland and will not be part of this year's coaching carousel.","published":"2026-11-24T20:33:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50585465/charles-huff-says-not-candidate-maryland-hc-job","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"NCAA sanctions Liberty over tampering with two players before entering portal","description":"Among the penalties the NCAA announced against Liberty, two coaches and the GM received show-cause penalties over tampering.","published":"2026-11-24T20:05:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50585093/ncaa-sanctions-liberty-transfer-portal-tampering","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Five-star OT Lincoln Fa'alafi commits to Notre Dame, to join 2028 class","description":"New Zealand native Lincoln Fa'alafi, ESPN's No. 8 overall prospect in the 2028 cycle, committed Tuesday to Notre Dame.","published":"2026-11-24T19:56:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50584881/notre-dame-gets-2028-commitment-ot-lincoln-faalafi","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"A timeline of Michigan athletics since 2017","description":"Warde Manuel's eventful decade in Ann Arbor has been marked by athletic successes and marred by controversy.","published":"2026-11-24T18:47:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49351177/2026-michigan-warde-manuel-athletic-department-tenure-line-investigation","type":"Story","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios in Week 13?","description":"Plenty of spots are still up for grabs entering the final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-24T18:22:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583399/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-13","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Trev Alberts told he won't be Michigan AD after agreement","description":"Trev Alberts was \"shocked and disheartened\" to be informed by the search firm representing Michigan that he will not be the Wolverines' next AD, he told ESPN.","published":"2026-11-24T23:50:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583155/attorney-trev-alberts-told-next-ad-michigan","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel and Dan Wetzel","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5112647/jordan-ross","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jordan_Ross_(American_football)"},"pick":{"pick":49,"round":2,"team":"LAR","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Jordan Ross (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jordan_Ross_(American_football)","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-22T04:18:09Z","intro":"Jordan Destin Ross is an American college football defensive end for the LSU Tigers. He previously played for the Tennessee Volunteers.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Ross is from Vestavia Hills, Alabama. He attended Vestavia Hills High School where he played football as a defensive end. As a junior in 2022, he helped Vestavia Hills to the second round of the Class 7A playoffs while posting 49 tackles, 16 tackles-for-loss and 2.5 sacks, as well as scoring two defensive touchdowns. He then totaled 72 tackles, 23 tackles-for-loss and 12.5 sacks as a senior, earning selection to the Under Armour All-America Game. Ross was named the 7A Defensive Player of the Year by Around The State Sports and as the Defensive Player of the Year by the Over the Mountain Journal.\nA five-star recruit, Ross was ranked a top-10 player nationally as well as the best edge rusher in the nation by 247Sports and On3.com. He committed to play college football for the Tennessee Volunteers. He was the highest-ranked member of Tennessee's 2024 recruiting class."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Ross entered his true freshman season in 2024 as a backup defensive end, behind James Pearce Jr., Joshua Josephs and Caleb Herring. He was used mainly on special teams and posted three tackles, 1.5 tackles-for-loss and blocked a punt which he returned for a touchdown, earning selection to the Southeastern Conference (SEC) All-Freshman team. After Pearce graduated, Ross began seeing more significant playing time as a sophomore in the 2025 season."}]}}